WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.020
So the rumors were true.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.440
"The Wild Sex Life of Kanna Hatano"

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:17.280
"School Withdrawal Form"
"Student Name: Kanna Hatano"
"Reason: Family Reasons"

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:17.280
We can assume there's some reason
she needs to stay near Mt. Sankaku,

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.160
and also a reason she has
to keep transferring schools.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.750
That's why I asked you to look after her.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:30.130
You've noticed, haven't you?

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:35.120
Her secret is deeply
connected with your parents.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.500
She went home. You know
what you have to do, right?

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:45.270
Yeah.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.320
Did you see what was on the board?

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:52.570
I sure did!

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:53.740
That's crazy, isn't it?

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:55.650
She's going to be transferring soon, I heard.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:56.910
So she'll be expelled?

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.010
Expelled?

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.950
This is getting out of control...

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:04.650
Arima-<i>kun</i>...

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:09.340
Where could he have gone at a time like this?

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.210
Kanna-<i>chan</i>, you're in there, right?

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:17.640
Kanna-<i>chan</i>?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:58.990
"Episode 17: A Pale, Ephemeral Vow"

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.380
What do you want?

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:05.820
When I was a kid, you were the one
I saw at the beach, weren't you?

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.750
You haven't aged in 50 years.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.630
That's why you keep transferring
schools around Sakaimachi.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.200
So nobody will suspect your age.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.540
Am I wrong?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.600
Is that all?

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:29.180
Is that all you want to ask me?

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.910
I don't want to know about your past...

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.130
I, um...

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.410
I want to know about you!

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:47.230
When I'm with you,
it feels like I'm with family.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.340
It's weird, but...

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.540
Family?

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.110
Just tell me what you can.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.660
You don't have to say
anything you don't want to.

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:03.010
So just... tell me about yourself.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.140
How you feel.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.240
There was a girl.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:23.370
A girl without a father. Who lived
with her mother, whom she loved.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:30.290
The mother was like a sister to her.
And a good friend.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:35.790
"Hotel"

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:35.790
But they couldn't stay in one place for long.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.800
They didn't age like normal people.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:44.550
Even as the years passed,
their appearances didn't change.

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:50.620
Eventually, her mother passed.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.520
The girl cried.

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:55.670
She cried for a long time.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:59.770
She didn't go to an orphanage.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.990
She decided to live on her own.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:07.200
It was hard to survive on her own.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:14.790
But by then, she began
to realize that she was a woman.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:19.710
Bodies can connect much easier than minds.

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:24.610
That's why she sought
a connection with someone.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.740
She felt so pathetic.

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.390
She couldn't forgive herself. The poor girl.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:37.450
She thought so many times
about going to be with her mother.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:42.050
But before she died, her mother had said,

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.560
"As long as you don't die, there is hope.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:49.660
And as long as there is hope,
there is possibility.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:55.320
And as long as there is possibility,
you must continue to live."

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:02.250
So the girl did as she was told
and did her best to survive.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:11.720
And then one day, she met...

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:14.770
A friendly man who laughed often.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.490
And a quiet, elegant woman.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.900
The two were like husband and wife.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:25.110
They said they would take her in.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:30.820
And gave her deep love
and affection, like true parents.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.410
That old bastard did 
something good, at least.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.960
But they're gone now.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.170
The girl was alone again.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.420
There was nothing left to do but

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:52.430
feel pity for herself as she faced
each day the same as the last.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.760
That's not true!

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.220
Me and Mio and Yuki are all your friends!

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:59.670
You're not alone! We're with you!

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.340
Don't say that.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.180
I know you actually look down on me.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.150
No, that's not true!

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.030
Then...

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:23.300
Can you look at me?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:29.020
Can you hold me in your arms?

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:46.420
Yes?

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.740
I made it so you couldn't go to school.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:53.740
Now maybe I'll kill Kodai Arima's son.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:03.000
Come to Meiunji Park at 
9:00 PM. The fountain.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.210
You can't escape me.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.390
Was that Hojo?

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.510
Leave me alone.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:12.880
I can't...

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:15.470
Please leave.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.260
I can't stay with you.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.370
Boss, you left this behind!

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.960
Oh, sorry.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:33.360
Bye.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.160
Hey, you were with Kanna-<i>chan</i>, right?

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.850
Is she really leaving school?

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.230
She seems firm about it.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.420
She said she's moving, too.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.840
And we finally got to
be friends with her, too...

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.370
So you just left?

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.840
She said she can't stay with me.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.010
She was clear.

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.830
There's nothing I can do.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.880
That's not like you, Arima-<i>kun</i>.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.400
Giving up so easily...

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:11.320
Don't say that. You don't
have any idea what's going on!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.820
Yup. I don't know a thing.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.820
I don't, but I didn't think
you were the kind of person

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.950
who'd just let a friend leave
without saying anything.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:26.430
That day we spent at the beach
is something I'll never forgot.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:30.290
I didn't know Kanna-<i>chan </i>could smile like that.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:38.530
I don't know what her reasons are.
But girls are strange things.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:43.960
Sometimes they actually like you,
but they act cold deliberately.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:47.110
It's about time you realized that!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.900
Thanks, Mio.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.750
Shimazu-<i>san</i>...

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.300
I'm sorry, Yuki-<i>kun</i>.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:03.290
Let me be alone for a little.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:10.860
Kanna-<i>chan</i>!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:36.070
"Meiunji Park
9 o'clock - Fountain"

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:44.160
I'm sorry she's leaving the school,
but it was her decision.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.290
There's nothing we can do.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:48.710
I know. But...

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:51.130
Hatano-<i>san</i> is a friend.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:56.380
We haven't known each other long,
but she's dear to me.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:02.090
I don't know what's going on
with her, but I want to help.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:05.600
And I'm worried about that weird guy.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:06.600
Weird guy?

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:10.350
Hatano-<i>san</i> was being stalked.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.320
Where is she?

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.240
Cut the crap!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.910
Where is Kodai Arima? Tell me!

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.700
Tell me!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:29.910
Stop it!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:35.000
You pervert!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:39.540
Arima-<i>san</i>, stay away! Please!

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:41.300
Leave me alone--

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.410
Shut up!

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:45.270
Bastard!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:51.480
My head! It hurts so much!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:55.400
Him too?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.950
Perfect...

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:05.530
I can carve you up in front of her.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:13.230
Stop it, please.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:21.180
I'll tell you about Kodai-<i>san</i>.

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.140
Kodai Arima-<i>san</i> is...

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.640
No, Kanna-<i>chan</i>!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.450
He's no longer in this world.

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:38.310
He left to a different place...
a different dimension.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.890
You've heard of Dela Granto, yes?

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.550
It's where my mother is from, right?

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:50.280
Dela Granto exists in another universe.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:55.800
But once every 400 years,
when it approaches Sakaimachi,

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.940
a very small amount of people
come to this dimension.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:04.170
Then my mother and Keiko-<i>san</i>...

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.440
Yes.

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:10.720
Keiko is... No, I should
call her by her true name.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:14.170
Keitia is gone.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:20.080
"I must go on a journey, for the next me."

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:22.670
That's what she said before she left.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:24.440
That's...

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.850
She left this for me.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.040
She must have brought it from Dela Granto.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:34.750
It's not something that
originally existed in this world.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:40.850
History does not repeat. It flows one way.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.250
But the flow of time is different.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.100
Keitia made me sure of this.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.550
That's why I'm going to see her.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.830
As a historian.

00:13:57.820 --> 00:13:59.890
As a man.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:12.030
Then my dad left this
world to follow my mom?

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:13.530
Yes.

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:18.370
Oh, I see!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:21.380
Of course I'm not going to believe that!

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.090
Stop it!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.460
It's true!

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:27.260
You can't come up with a better lie?

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.800
Tell the truth, or I'll...

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.350
Knock it off already!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.460
Kanna-<i>chan</i>, are you okay?

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.190
Arima-<i>san</i>, why?

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.060
Why...

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:55.110
I can't really understand your pain.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:59.710
But you're alive. You're here.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.540
I'm alive, and nothing more.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:05.510
I have no dignity as a human being.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.640
What point is there in my living?

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.970
Stop bringing yourself down.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.390
But... But I...

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:17.130
You're not alone.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:21.990
Don't just decide that
there's no reason for you to exist!

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:26.460
Mio and Yuki both really care about you.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:32.140
You're very dear to me, too.

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:36.650
Come live with me.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:52.930
Get back!

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.370
Arima-<i>san</i>!

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.420
This looks dangerous...

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:18.910
Arima-<i>san</i>!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.770
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>?

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.520
Sorry I'm late...

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.700
What are you doing here?

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.610
And why are you dressed like that?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.450
I've been keeping tabs on him for a while.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:55.210
I'm more interested in
his employer, not him, though.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.800
His employer?

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.240
That bastard Ryuzoji?

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.710
He was probably controlled by the Niarb.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:08.520
Shimazu-<i>kun</i> had just come
to talk to me about Hatano-<i>kun</i>.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.050
So I raced over here.

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.420
Mio went to talk to you?

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.090
Let me deal with him.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.930
I'll have questions for him later.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.130
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>...

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.690
Take care of Hatano-<i>kun</i>.

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:30.340
Kanna-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:35.310
My pendant...

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:42.290
Kanna-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:44.710
Here you go!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.910
What's going on? The light...

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:01.630
Arima-<i>san</i>...

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.140
Kanna-<i>chan</i>, wake up!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.120
Kanna-<i>chan</i>!

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.230
It's because of this thing.

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:14.760
Then if I go back to before it broke...

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:23.650
I can't...

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:27.960
If it broke then, then 
just going back won't...

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.320
This is bad.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.250
Her fever's awful.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.780
Kanna-<i>chan</i>, what is that pendant?

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.310
The flame of my life...

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.280
Psychite...

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:04.190
Psychite?

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:05.840
What Geotech was after?

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:13.140
The stuff under Sakaimachi, right?

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:16.720
They said they hadn't
succeeded in crystallizing it yet.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.350
This is a different dimension.

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:24.470
The stone only exists in Dela Granto.

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.200
It's only there?

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.220
Yes.

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:32.230
It can't be crystallized here in this world.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.150
I'm sorry.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.780
I think it's over...

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.240
Kanna-<i>chan</i>...

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:48.710
Even after you said I'm not alone...
that you wanted to live with me...

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.610
I'll go get some psychite.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:56.710
Psychite!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:59.240
I'll get it from another dimension!

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:00.870
I promise!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:02.780
So just wait for me!

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:16.350
I guess it's time to tell you
Kodai-<i>san</i>'s last message for you.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:26.710
You need eight jewels to go to Dela Granto.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:31.660
The last jewel is in his study.

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:36.150
Inside the grandfather clock.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:49.250
When all the jewels are in your possession,

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:52.130
go to the caves under Mt. Sankaku.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.070
The burial chamber in the far back.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:04.210
Kanna-<i>chan</i>...

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.580
I'll never let you be alone again!

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:35.310
You who bear the seal of the king.

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:42.220
When light and shadow,
heavenly being and devil combine.

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:47.980
The name of the king
will appear above thy head.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:52.380
Speak the name of the king.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.000
The name of the king is...

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:41.570
"Episode 18: Twilight in Dela Granto"

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:39.400
Episode 18: "Twilight in Dela Granto."
